  "notes": "From the host's point of view, the controller's identity is fingerprinted by (VID, SSVID, SN, MN, FR, IEEE OUI, FGUID) from Identify Controller plus (NGUID, EUI64) per namespace. Used by enterprise inventory and TCG Opal Locking SP.",
